# Firebase BFF contract

The mobile app talks to **`/v1/*` HTTPS Cloud Functions only**. Tenant root on the server is `admins/{adminId}`; every call is scoped by the signed-in user's `clientId`.

## ID mapping (use in DTOs and routes)

| App concept | API / CRM ID |
|-------------|----------------|
| Client | `clientId` |
| Traveller | `travellerId` (= `customerId`) |
| Trip / booking | `bookingId` = `tripId` = `customerVisitId` |
| Quote | `quoteId` = `quotationId` |
| Request | `requestId` = `enquiryId` |

## Contracts

- Request/response shapes live in `src/api/contracts` as Zod schemas + inferred TypeScript types.
- Do not invent endpoints; backend owns the endpoint list.
- Collection and module mapping: `docs/FIREBASE_MAP.md`.
